### 5.3 Convert Actions

Transform the selected card into:

| Artifact | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| **Task** | Create a TODO item from insights |
| **Document** | Export as standalone markdown |
| **GitHub Issue** | Create issue with card content |
| **Whitepaper Seed** | Start a new whitepaper |
| **Summary** | Generate condensed version |

### 5.4 Contextual Display

Actions shown depend on card state:

```typescript
const getAvailableActions = (card: TurnCard): Action[] => {
  const actions: Action[] = [];

  // Always available
  actions.push({ type: "collapse", label: card.collapsed ? "Expand" : "Collapse" });
  actions.push({ type: "tag", label: "Add Tag" });
  actions.push({ type: "copy", label: "Copy" });

  // Only in main carousel
  if (!card.promotedFrom) {
    actions.push({ type: "branch", label: "Branch Here" });
  }

  // Only in side thread
  if (card.promotedFrom) {
    actions.push({ type: "promote", label: "Promote to Main" });
  }

  // Content-dependent
  if (card.aiContent.length > 500) {
    actions.push({ type: "summarize", label: "Summarize" });
  }

  if (card.hasCode) {
    actions.push({ type: "exportCode", label: "Export Code" });
  }

  // Conversion always available
  actions.push({ type: "convert", label: "Convert to..." });

  return actions;
};
```

