## 7. Component Styles

### 7.1 Buttons

```css
/* Primary button - Ink style */
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--ink-primary);
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  cursor: pointer;
