   630→## 8. Context Building
   631→
   632→### 8.1 System Prompt Construction
   633→
   634→Uses the Context Assembler (Section 4.3) to fetch documents from Artifact Engine:
   635→
   636→```typescript
   637→const buildSystemPrompt = async (
   638→  persona: Persona,
   639→  scope: ContextScope,
   640→  distillation?: SessionDistillation
   641→): Promise<string> => {
   642→  // 1. Base persona prompt
   643→  let prompt = persona.systemPrompt;
   644→
   645→  // 2. Fetch documents from Artifact Engine via Context Assembler
   646→  const assembled = await assembleContext(scope);
   647→
   648→  prompt += `\n\n## Reference Documents\n\n`;
   649→  prompt += `You have access to the following documents. Reference them when answering questions.\n\n`;
   650→  prompt += assembled.contextString;
   651→
   652→  // 3. Add distillation context (if exists)
   653→  if (distillation) {
   654→    prompt += `\n\n## Session Context\n\n`;
   655→    prompt += `Summary so far: ${distillation.summary}\n\n`;
   656→    prompt += `Key insights explored:\n`;
   657→    distillation.keyInsights.forEach(i => prompt += `- ${i}\n`);
   658→  }
   659→
   660→  return prompt;
   661→};
   662→```
   663→
   664→### 8.2 Token Budget (Future V2)
   665→
   666→For smart selection in V2:
   667→
   668→```typescript
   669→interface TokenBudget {
   670→  systemPrompt: number;      // ~500 tokens
   671→  documents: number;         // ~100k tokens available
   672→  conversation: number;      // ~8k tokens for history
   673→  response: number;          // ~4k tokens reserved
   674→}
   675→
   676→// V2: Select documents per-turn based on query
   677→const selectRelevantDocs = async (
   678→  query: string,
   679→  scope: ContextScope,
   680→  budget: number
   681→): Promise<ArtifactSearchResult[]> => {
   682→  // Use Artifact Engine search with keywords extracted from query
   683→  const keywords = extractKeywords(query);
   684→  const results = await artifactClient.search({
   685→    domain: "whitepapers",
   686→    keywords,
   687→  });
   688→
   689→  // Filter to stay within token budget
   690→  return filterByTokenBudget(results, budget);
   691→};
   692→```
